sequenceDiagram
  participant Owner
  participant SA as Super admin
  participant Web as Web app
  participant API
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant Mail as SMTP mail
  alt Path A - self-signup
    Owner->>Web: Fill Create your clinic form
    Web->>API: POST /auth/register
    API->>PG: user, organization, MAIN location, ownership, feature rows, system roles, 14-day trial
    API->>Mail: verification link, failure only logged
    API-->>Web: signed-in 30-day session
    Owner->>Web: Setup wizard, three steps
    Web->>API: PATCH /account/setup/clinic, PATCH /account/setup/location, POST /account/setup/complete
  else Path B - super admin creates the organization
    SA->>Web: Organizations, Create
    Web->>API: POST /organizations
    API->>PG: organization, feature rows, system roles - no owner, no location, no dates
    SA->>Web: Locations, Create Location, organization picked
    Web->>API: POST /locations
    SA->>Web: Select the organization and location, then User Admin, Create User, type Owner
    Web->>API: POST /user
    API->>PG: user plus organization_ownership row
  end
  SA->>Web: Manage features, Entitled switch or Entitle module
  Web->>API: PATCH /feature-flags/org/:organizationId/:featureKey/entitlement
  API->>PG: entitlement saved, access_version raised
  Owner->>Web: Features page, switch the feature on
  Web->>API: PATCH /admin/features/:key
  Owner->>Web: Roles, Locations, Theme, Navigation, Employees
  Web->>API: PATCH /admin/roles/:id, POST /locations, PUT /admin/theme, PUT /admin/navigation, POST /employees
